Added:
    20-Sep-2026
Status:
    succeeds # One of [succeeds|failing since <date>|obsolete| ...]
Recommended resolution:
    96x96x96 (nu = 100·10^8 m²/s)
Comments:
    Test run to perform a velocity driving in the vertical velocity.
    The xy-plane at z-grid point 11 is driven towards the target.
    The target values are saved within the file "driver/vel-z.dat",
    and "driver/vel-z_times.dat" indicates the times of the target.
    The driver files use SI units.
References:
    Bourdin: 2020, GAFD 114 (1-2), 235--260,
    DOI: 10.1080/03091929.2019.1643849,
    https://adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2020GApFD.114..235B
